    "{\n",
    " \"cells\": [\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"# K-Phase: Knowledge Transfer (Deployment)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## Ziel\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Die K-Phase überführt das ausgewählte Modell aus der Analyse in eine betreibbare Lösung mit dokumentierter Übergabe.\\n\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"d5373c47ab18a1df\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Deployment-Strategie\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Option 1: Embedded Deployment (Streamlit)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Modell wird direkt in der App geladen.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Vorteil: schnell umsetzbar, geringe Infrastruktur.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Nachteil: begrenzte Skalierbarkeit.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Option 2: Model-as-a-Service (FastAPI)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Modell als separater Inferenzservice (`/predict`).\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Vorteil: entkoppelte Architektur, bessere Skalierbarkeit und Wiederverwendbarkeit.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Nachteil: höherer Betriebs- und Monitoringaufwand.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## Empfohlenes Zielbild\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Kurzfristig Embedded für Demo/PoC, mittelfristig Migration auf FastAPI-Inferenzservice mit Streamlit als Client.\\n\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"988ceba154767e56\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"markdown\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## K-Check: Deployment und Repository-?bergabe\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Die fertige Streamlit App**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  ?bergabe erfolgt ?ber die App im Repository (`src/traffic_app`) inklusive Modellartefakt und Reports.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- **Das GitHub Repo**\\n\",\n",
    "    \"  Das Repo enth?lt reproduzierbare Notebook-Phasen (Q/U/A/C/K), Exportartefakte unter `reports/` sowie Dokumentation unter `docs/`.\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"e9040418aca1a473\"\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-03-21T17:54:06.649724100Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-03-21T17:54:06.551309100Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"from pathlib import Path\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import json\\n\",\n",
    "    \"import pandas as pd\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"repo_root = Path.cwd().parent if Path.cwd().name == \\\"notebooks\\\" else Path.cwd()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"REPORT_DIR = repo_root / \\\"reports\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"MODEL_DIR = REPORT_DIR / \\\"models\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"summary_path = REPORT_DIR / \\\"model_summary.json\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"results_path = REPORT_DIR / \\\"model_results.csv\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"missing = [str(p) for p in [summary_path, results_path] if not p.exists()]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"if missing:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    raise FileNotFoundError(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        \\\"A-Phase-Ergebnisse fehlen. Bitte zuerst A-Phase_Algorithms.ipynb ausf?hren. Fehlend: \\\" + \\\", \\\".join(missing)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    )\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"summary = json.loads(summary_path.read_text(encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\"))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"results = pd.read_csv(results_path).sort_values(\\\"RMSE\\\").reset_index(drop=True)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"best_model = summary[\\\"best_model\\\"]\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"artifact_candidates = list(MODEL_DIR.glob(f\\\"best_model_{best_model}.pkl\\\"))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"artifact_exists = len(artifact_candidates) > 0\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"portfolio_summary = {\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"Project\\\": \\\"Traffic Prediction & Optimization\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"Methodology\\\": \\\"QUA3CK\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"Best_Algorithm\\\": best_model,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"Dataset_Rows\\\": int(summary[\\\"dataset_rows\\\"]),\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"Train_Rows\\\": int(summary[\\\"n_train\\\"]),\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"Test_Rows\\\": int(summary[\\\"n_test\\\"]),\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"Top_Result\\\": results.iloc[0].to_dict(),\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"Model_Artifact_Available\\\": artifact_exists,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"Deployment_Target\\\": \\\"FastAPI Inference Service + Streamlit UI\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    \\\"Next_Steps\\\": [\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        \\\"API endpoint /predict mit Request-Validierung\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        \\\"Containerized deployment via docker compose\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        \\\"Monitoring: Latenz, Fehlerrate, RMSE-Drift\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        \\\"Regelmäßiges Re-Training mit aktuellen Verkehrsdaten\\\",\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    ],\\n\",\n",
    "    \"}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"K-Phase Portfolio Summary\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(\\\"=\\\" * 60)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"for key, value in portfolio_summary.items():\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(f\\\"{key}: {value}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"id\": \"2b6bad32c2a81e9a\",\n",
    "   \"outputs\": [\n",
    "    {\n",
    "     \"name\": \"stdout\",\n",
    "     \"output_type\": \"stream\",\n",
    "     \"text\": [\n",
    "      \"K-Phase Portfolio Summary\\n\",\n",
    "      \"============================================================\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Project: Traffic Prediction & Optimization\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Methodology: QUA3CK\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Best_Algorithm: RandomForest\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Dataset_Rows: 10056\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Train_Rows: 8044\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Test_Rows: 2012\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Top_Result: {'Model': 'RandomForest', 'MAE': 5.922399783931112, 'RMSE': 7.392613436255561, 'R2': 0.7877094830111565}\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Model_Artifact_Available: True\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Deployment_Target: FastAPI Inference Service + Streamlit UI\\n\",\n",
    "      \"Next_Steps: ['API endpoint /predict mit Request-Validierung', 'Containerized deployment via docker compose', 'Monitoring: Latenz, Fehlerrate, RMSE-Drift', 'Regelmäßiges Re-Training mit aktuellen Verkehrsdaten']\\n\"\n",
    "     ]\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   ],\n",
    "   \"execution_count\": 13\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-03-21T17:54:06.719390800Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-03-21T17:54:06.650694200Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"from textwrap import dedent\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"model_card = dedent(f\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Model Card (Kurzfassung)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## Modell\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Name: {summary['best_model']}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Anwendungsfall: Kurzfristige Verkehrsprognose (Stundenebene)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## Trainingskontext\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Datensätze: {summary['dataset_rows']}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Train/Test: {summary['n_train']} / {summary['n_test']} (chronologisch)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## Kernmetriken (Test)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- MAE: {results.iloc[0]['MAE']:.3f}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- RMSE: {results.iloc[0]['RMSE']:.3f}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- R2: {results.iloc[0]['R2']:.4f}\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"## Grenzen\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Synthetische Anteile möglich (abhängig von U-Phase-Konfiguration)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Externe Ereignisse (Unfälle, Großevents, Baustellen) nur begrenzt abgebildet\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Regelmäßige Validierung auf Live-Daten erforderlich\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\\"\\\"\\\").strip()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"repo_root = Path.cwd().parent if Path.cwd().name == \\\"notebooks\\\" else Path.cwd()\\n\",\n",
    "    \"model_card_path = repo_root / \\\"docs\\\" / \\\"guides\\\" / \\\"model-card.md\\\"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Fehlende Verzeichnisse robust anlegen\\n\",\n",
    "    \"model_card_path.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Datei schreiben\\n\",\n",
    "    \"model_card_path.write_text(model_card, encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"Model Card geschrieben: {model_card_path.resolve()}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"print(f\\\"Aktueller Arbeitsordner: {Path.cwd()}\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\"\n",
    "   ],\n",
